Subject: expose optional terminal collector hooks
Upstream-Status: Local embedding (not submitted)

Report logical input, terminal buffer mutations, output class, and balanced
man/mdoc node phases to an optional per-renderer observer.  The observer is
read-only and nullable, so ordinary terminal rendering follows the original
state transitions.

